                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Grumbles about outages or a cold garage</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Backup power or garage heat</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Picks -->
        <div id="top-picks" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            3. The 16 Best Christmas Gifts for Men Who Have Everything
          </h2>

          <p>
            Nine of these picks come straight from our own buyer's guides, where each holds a named spot such as Best Overall; the other seven are current models checked against the maker's own listing. Each card shows which kind of gift it is and a rough price band, since holiday prices move week to week. For a wider field, our main <a href="/best-christmas-gifts-for-men/">best Christmas gifts for men</a> guide covers every kind of man and budget, and our <a href="/christmas-gifts-for-men-under-50/">Christmas gifts for men under $50</a> guide handles the smaller gifts.
          </p>

          {PRODUCTS.map((product, index) => (
            <div id={product.id} class="scroll-mt-24 mt-12 first:mt-8">
